 R←TestSky;m;b;same;sep;long;lat;time;date;earth;stars;planets;moon;sun;ref;err
⍝ Positions on the sky for the Anaheim observation, 1974-05-16 05:00 UTC
⍝ (33.767N, 117.833W): exactly the book's results, and within the book
⍝ tests' tolerances of the JPL DE421 reference positions
 m←## ⋄ b←##.Data ⋄ R←1
 same←{(⊃⍵)≡2⊃⍵:1 ⋄ 0⊣⎕←'FAIL: TestSky: ',⍺}
⍝ Angular separation in degrees between RA (hours), Dec (degrees) rows
 sep←{ra←15×|⍺[;1]-⍵[;1] ⋄ ra←(2○○⍵[;2]÷180)×ra⌊360-ra ⋄ ((ra*2)+(⍺[;2]-⍵[;2])*2)*0.5}

 long←¯117.833 ⋄ lat←33.767
 time←long m.TIMEADJUST 5
 date←(m.JNU 5 16 1974)+(time÷24)-long÷360
 earth←lat,date,time

 stars←(date-b.CATEPOCH)m.PRECESS b.STARS
 R∧←'PRECESS'same stars((date-b.CATEPOCH)b.PRECESS b.STARS)
 R∧←'SKYPOS stars'same(earth m.SKYPOS stars)(earth b.SKYPOS stars)
 planets←date m.EARTHVIEW date m.PLANETPOS b.planets
 R∧←'EARTHVIEW planets'same planets(date b.EARTHVIEW date b.PLANETPOS b.planets)
 sun←date m.EARTHVIEW 1 3⍴0 0 0
 R∧←'EARTHVIEW sun'same sun(date b.EARTHVIEW 1 3⍴0 0 0)
 moon←m.MOONPOS date
 R∧←'MOONPOS'same moon(b.MOONPOS date)
 R∧←'PARALLAXADJUST'same(moon[;3]m.PARALLAXADJUST earth m.SKYPOS moon[;1 2])(moon[;3]b.PARALLAXADJUST earth b.SKYPOS moon[;1 2])

 ref←b.reference_positions
 :If 0.15<err←⌈/stars sep ref[⍳332;]
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestSky: stars max error ',(⍕err),'deg (tolerance 0.15deg)' ⋄ R←0
 :EndIf
 :If 10<err←⊃moon[;1 2]sep ref[,333;]
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestSky: moon error ',(⍕err),'deg (tolerance 10deg)' ⋄ R←0
 :EndIf
 :If 3<err←⊃sun[;1 2]sep ref[,334;]
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestSky: sun error ',(⍕err),'deg (tolerance 3deg)' ⋄ R←0
 :EndIf

 :If R
     ⎕←'PASS: TestSky'
 :EndIf
